    {
      "id": "claim_b0c2098423a94e96b285a109a6d5d3a2",
      "statement": "`JwtServiceAdapter`, the conditional `TokenServicePort` supplied by `EngineSecurityBeansConfiguration`, signs access JWTs with HS256 using the configured secret and access expiration, but generates refresh tokens as UUIDs; `AuthService.refresh` subsequently calls `extractUserEmail` on the refresh token, which parses a signed JWS, creating a refresh-format incompatibility in the shipped active wiring.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://engine-core/src/main/java/com/engine/core/services/AuthService.java#L66-L82",
