      "id": "claim_5f6466ab82354fb9ba9569760deb6bd1",
      "statement": "The imported `SecurityConfig` configures a stateless JWT filter chain: it permits configured public paths, restricts `/admin/**` to `ROLE_ADMIN`, requires authentication otherwise, and inserts `JwtAuthenticationFilter` before `UsernamePasswordAuthenticationFilter`.",
